00:05:48,850 --> 00:05:54,850
[ON THE PLAIN BELOW]
The Nadders have cornered the house-full of sheep. They close in, ready to spring upon them. Stoick suddenly appears, HURLING FISHING NETS over them. The surprised Nadders are caught. Stoick and his men rush in. A Nadder blasts a hole through its net. Stoick leaps onto it, clamping his thick arms around its head, forcing its jaws shut.
ພໍ່ເອີຍ... Stoick ຢືນ, ດູດຫາຍໃຈເລິກ.

74
00:05:55,350 --> 00:05:58,850
[STOICK]
Mind yourselves! The devils still have some juice in them.
ໂອ້, ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຮູ້ວ່າ.

75
00:05:59,350 --> 00:06:05,350
[ON THE PLAIN ABOVE]
Hiccup reaches a cliff overlooking the smoking CATAPULT and drops the handles to the ground. He cranks several levers, unfolding and then cocking the bowed arms of his contraption. He drops a bola onto a chamber and then pivots the weapon on a gimbal head toward the dark sky. He listens, with his eye pressed to the scope, hand poised on the trigger. He hears the NIGHT FURY approaching... and turns his aim to the defense tower. It closes in for the final strike, completely camouflaged in the night.
ບໍ່, ເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້.

76
00:06:05,850 --> 00:06:11,850
[HICCUP]
Come on. Give me something to shoot at, give me something to shoot at. KABLAM! The tower topples. The blast of fire illuminates the dragon for a split second. Hiccup pulls the trigger. KERTHUNK! The flexed arms SNAP forward, springing the weapon off the ground. The bola disappears into the sky, followed by a WHACK and a SCREECH.
ບໍ່, ເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້!

77
00:06:12,350 --> 00:06:18,350
[HICCUP]
Oh I hit it! Yes, I hit it! Did anybody see that? Hiccup's victory is short-lived. A Monstrous Nightmare appears, slithering up over the lip of the cliff.
ເພື່ອຕອບສະຫນອງ, ຫນ່ວຍດັບເພີງໄດ້ແລ່ນຜ່ານສວນ - ສີ່ໄວລຸ້ນ, ດຶງຖັງໄມ້ຂະຫນາດໃຫຍ່ໃສ່ລໍ້. ຈາກມັນ,
ພວກເຂົາໄດ້ຕື່ມນໍ້າໃສ່ຖັງເພື່ອປິດໄຟ. ຫນຶ່ງໃນພວກມັນແມ່ນເດັກຍິງຊາວວິເຄນທີ່ຫນ້າຮັກ, ມີພະລັງ. Hiccup ຫັນອອກຈາກຕູ້ເພື່ອເບິ່ງນາງ.

78
00:06:18,850 --> 00:06:24,850
[HICCUP]
Except for you. ON STOICK, holding down the netted Nadders. He hears a familiar HOLLER and looks up to see... HICCUP running through the PLAZA, SCREAMING, with the NIGHTMARE fast on his heels. Alarmed, Stoick abandons the Nadders and runs off.
ບໍ່, ເຈົ້າໄປກ່ອນ.

79
00:06:25,350 --> 00:06:27,350
[STOICK]
(to his men, re: the
ໂອ, ດີເລີດ. ແລະໃນຂະນະທີ່ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າມີວຽກເຮັດງານທໍາ, Hiccup ສາມາດປົກຄຸມ stall. ໂລຫະລະລາຍ, ມີດຕັດ sharp,
ເວລາຫຼາຍສໍາລັບຕົນເອງ... ສິ່ງທີ່ອາດຈະໄປຜິດ? Stoick sinks ລົງເທິງ bench ຢູ່ຂ້າງ Gobber, ຫນ້າເອິກຂອງເຂົາ loaded.

80
00:06:27,850 --> 00:06:29,850
[NADDERS)]
DO NOT let them escape!
ເຮືອເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ ບໍ່ເຄີຍກັບມາ.

81
00:06:30,350 --> 00:06:36,350
[IN THE PLAZA]
Vikings scatter as Hiccup dodges a near fatal blast. The Nightmare's sticky, Napalm-like fire splashes up onto buildings, setting them alight. Hiccup ducks behind the last standing brazier -- the only shelter available. The Nightmare blasts it, spraying fire all around him. Hiccup peers around the smoldering post. No sign of the Nightmare. He turns back to find it leering at him, blocking his escape. It takes a deep breath. Hiccup is finished. Suddenly, Stoick LEAPS between them, tackling the Nightmare to the ground. They tumble and wrestle, resuming their earlier fight. The Nightmare tries to toast him, but only coughs up smoke.
ເລີຍ. ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຮູ້.

82
00:06:36,850 --> 00:06:42,850
[STOICK]
You're all out. He smashes the Nightmare repeatedly in the face, driving it away. It takes to the air and disappears. Winded, Stoick turns to Hiccup.
ມື້ນີ້ບໍ່ດີສໍາລັບຂ້ອຍ.

83
00:06:43,350 --> 00:06:46,850
[HICCUP]
Oh, and there's one more thing you need to know...
...ເຈົ້າຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດຖິ້ມອັນດຽວນີ້ໄດ້. ວິກິ້ງແລ່ນໄປແລະເອົາມັນອອກຈາກມືຂອງ Gobber,
ຖິ້ມມັນໃສ່ Gronkle ທີ່ຖີ້ມລະເບີດລົງ. ບານກ້ອນບິດຕີນຂອງມັນ, ສົ່ງມັນໄປສູ່ການຕໍາຢ່າງຫນັກ.

84
00:06:47,350 --> 00:06:49,350
[HICCUP]
Sorry, dad.
...ນີ້ຈະຖິ້ມມັນໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍ Hiccup ເປີດຝາປິດຂອງອຸປະກອນແຂນຫນຶ່ງ springing ຂຶ້ນ, ມີອຸປະກອນ twin
bow ພວກເຂົາມີການປ່ອຍ bola prematurely, ຫາຍໄປ Gobber... ແລະເອົາ Viking ຢູ່ counter ໄດ້.

85
00:06:49,850 --> 00:06:55,850
[HICCUP]
Okay, but I hit a Night Fury. Stoick grabs Hiccup by the back scruff of his collar and hauls him away, fuming with embarrassment.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ບໍ່ຕະຫລົກ, ແມ່ນບໍ? ຄວາມເຈັບປວດ. ມັກມັນ.
ພວກນາຍໃຫມ່ຫັນໄປເບິ່ງ Hiccup ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງພວກເຂົາ. ທຸກບ່ອນຮ້ອງໄຫ້.

86
00:06:56,350 --> 00:07:02,350
[HICCUP]
It's not like the last few times, Dad. I mean I really actually hit it. You guys were busy and I had a very clear shot. It went down, just off Raven Point. Let's get a search party out there, before it--
Night ຟິວຣີ ຫຼຸດລົງ! Vikings
ທຸກບ່ອນເອົາທີ່ພັກອາໄສ. ສຽງຮ້ອງໄຫ້ສ້າງ.

87
00:07:02,850 --> 00:07:06,350
[STOICK]
--STOP! Just....stop. He releases Hiccup. Everyone goes silent, staring expectantly.
ເອົາມືເຈົ້າອອກຈາກປ້າຍຂອງຂ້ອຍ!

88
00:07:06,850 --> 00:07:12,850
[STOICK]
Every time you step outside, disaster follows. Can you not see that I have bigger problems? Winter's almost here and I have an entire village to feed! Hiccup looks around. All eyes are upon him.
ເມື່ອຂ້ອຍເປັນເດັກນ້ອຍ...

89
00:07:13,350 --> 00:07:19,350
[HICCUP]
Between you and me, the village could do with a little less feeding, don't ya think? A few rotund Vikings stir self-consciously.
ບັນຫາການປັບຂະຫນາດນ້ອຍ.

90
00:07:19,850 --> 00:07:21,850
[STOICK]
This isn't a joke, Hiccup!
ພໍ່ບອກຂ້ອຍໃຫ້ຕີຫົວໃສ່ກ້ອນຫີນ ແລະຂ້ອຍກໍເຮັດ. ຂ້ອຍຄິດວ່າມັນໂງ່
, ແຕ່ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ໄດ້ສອບຖາມລາວ. ແລະເຈົ້າຮູ້ບໍ່ວ່າມີຫຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນ?

91
00:07:22,350 --> 00:07:28,350
[HICCUP]
I can't stop myself. I see a dragon and I have to just... kill it, you know? It's who I am, Dad.
...ນີ້.

92
00:07:28,850 --> 00:07:34,850
[STOICK]
You are many things, Hiccup. But a dragon killer is not one of them. Sting. Hiccup looks around to see many nods of agreement.
ກ້ອນຫີນທີ່ແຕກອອກເປັນສອງ ມັນໄດ້ສອນຂ້າພະເຈົ້າສິ່ງທີ່ Viking
ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້, Gobber ລາວສາມາດ smash ພູເຂົາ, level ປ່າໄມ້, ທະເລ tamed!

93
00:07:35,350 --> 00:07:37,350
[STOICK]
Get back to the house.
ເຈົ້າຄິດຜິດເລື່ອງນີ້ ມັນບໍ່ສໍາຄັນວ່າເຈົ້າເບິ່ງຄືແນວໃດ
ມັນເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນທີ່ລາວບໍ່ສາມາດທົນໄດ້

94
00:07:37,850 --> 00:07:39,850
[TUFFNUT]
Quite the performance.
Uggh, ພຣະເຈົ້າກຽດຊັງຂ້າພະເຈົ້າ. ບາງຄົນສູນເສຍມີດ ຫຼືຈອກຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າ. ບໍ່, ບໍ່ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າ. ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຈັດການທີ່ຈະສູນເສຍ dragon ທັງ ຫມົດ. Hiccup HACKS ສາຂາຕໍ່າ hanging. ມັນ SNAPS ກັບເຂົາ,
ຕີລາວໃນໃບຫນ້າ. ລາວເບິ່ງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເຫັນຕົ້ນໄມ້ທີ່ແຕກຫັກ. ຕາຂອງລາວຕິດຕາມມັນໄປຫາຮ່ອງຍາວຂອງດິນທີ່ຫັນຂຶ້ນ. ລາວຕິດຕາມມັນມາຫາມ້າມົນ, ສີດໍາທີ່ຕົກລົງ, ຮ່າງກາຍແລະຄໍຂອງມັນຕິດຢູ່ໃນບານ. ມັນເບິ່ງຄື

95
00:07:40,350 --> 00:07:43,850
[SNOTLOUT]
I've never seen anyone mess up that badly. That helped!
ບໍ່, ຂ້ອຍເວົ້າຈິງ.

96
00:07:44,350 --> 00:07:50,350
[HICCUP]
Thank you, thank you. I was trying, so... Hiccup avoids Astrid's glare and heads up toward a large house, standing prominently on the hill above the others.
ແຕ່ເຈົ້າຈະຂ້າຫມອນ.

97
00:07:50,850 --> 00:07:52,850
[HICCUP]
I really did hit one.
ດີ. ພວກທີ່ຢູ່ຈະເບິ່ງແຍງ Hiccup. ມືອອກໄປໃນອາກາດ, ສະຫມັກໃຈຢ່າງຫລວງຫລາຍ
. ສຽງດັງຂອງຄວາມກະຕືລືລົ້ນໃນການກະກຽມ ແລະການຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ເຕັມຫ້ອງ.

98
00:07:53,350 --> 00:07:55,350
[GOBBER]
Sure, Hiccup.
ຂ້ອຍຢູ່ກັບເຈົ້າ Stoick!

99
00:07:55,850 --> 00:07:57,850
[HICCUP]
He never listens.
ຂ້ອຍຈະຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ເສື້ອຜ້າຊັ້ນໃນ.

100
00:07:58,350 --> 00:08:00,450
[GOBBER]
Well, it runs in the family.
ໃຫ້ເລີ້ມຕົ້ນ! ຄົນໃຫມ່ທີ່ເຮັດໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດ
ຈະໄດ້ຮັບກຽດຕິຍົດໃນການຂ້າຫມອນຄົນທໍາອິດ ຂອງຕົນ ຢູ່ຕໍ່ຫນ້າ ຫມູ່ບ້ານທັງຫມົດ.

101
00:08:00,950 --> 00:08:06,950
[HICCUP]
And when he does, it's always with this... disappointed scowl. Like someone skimped on the meat in his sandwich.
ເອົາລາວໄປຝຶກອົບຮົມກັບຄົນອື່ນ.

102
00:08:07,450 --> 00:08:13,450
[GOBBER]
You're thinking about this all wrong. It's not so much what you look like. It's what's inside that he can't stand. Beat.
ຂ້ອຍສາມາດຍ້າຍໄປຫ້ອງຮຽນກັບຊາວໄວຄິງທີ່ເຢັນໄດ້ບໍ?
Gobber ວາງແຂນສະຫນັບສະຫນູນອ້ອມ Hiccup ແລະນໍາລາວໄປ.

103
00:08:13,950 --> 00:08:17,450
[HICCUP]
Thank you, for summing that up. They reach the doorway.
ໂອhhh...

104
00:08:17,950 --> 00:08:23,550
[GOBBER]
Look, the point is, stop trying so hard to be something you're not. Hiccup SIGHS heavily.
ບໍ່ມີການກັບຄືນ.

105
00:08:24,050 --> 00:08:30,050
[HICCUP]
I just want to be one of you guys. Gobber eyes him sympathetically. Hiccup turns and goes through the front door. And straight out the back door. He hurries off into the woods, determined.
ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງປະຕູເຫລົ່ານີ້ ມີພຽງບາງຊະນິດເທົ່ານັ້ນ ທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະຮຽນຮູ້ທີ່ຈະຕໍ່ສູ້
Fishlegs ກະໂດດແລະຂີ້ຕົມດ້ວຍຄວາມຕື່ນເຕັ້ນ ບໍ່ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຕົນເອງໄດ້

106
00:08:30,550 --> 00:08:36,550
[STOICK]
Either we finish them or they'll finish us! It's the only way we'll be rid of them! If we find the nest and destroy it, the dragons will leave. They'll find another home.
ຄວາມໄວ 8 ປ້ອງກັນ 16

107
00:08:37,050 --> 00:08:39,850
[STOICK]
One more search. Before the ice sets in.
ບວກກັບ 11 ລັກສະນະທີ່ລີ້ຊັບ.

108
00:08:40,350 --> 00:08:42,350
[VIKING]
Those ships never come back.
ບໍ່, 6 ຄົນ

109
00:08:42,850 --> 00:08:48,850
[STOICK]
We're Vikings. It's an occupational hazard. Now who's with me? Stoick throws up his fist. No one follows. The crowds shifts in restless silence. Head scratches. Eyes averted.
ພະລັງງານໄຟ 15

110
00:08:49,350 --> 00:08:51,350
[VIKING]
Today's not good for me.
ໂອ້ ຜູ້ຊາຍ, ຂ້ອຍຄວນຈະໄປກ່ອນ ເພາະວ່າຂ້ອຍຄິດວ່າ, ເຈົ້າຮູ້ບໍ່ວ່າ
ພວກເຮົາມີຊາວໄວເຄິ້ງທີ່ຕໍ່ສູ້ກັບຫມາກມັງກອນຫຼາຍປານໃດ, ແຕ່ພວກເຮົາມີຊາວ ໄວເຄີ້ງທີ່ເຮັດເຂົ້າຈີ່ພຽງພໍຫຼືບ້ານນ້ອຍໆ

111
00:08:51,850 --> 00:08:53,950
[VIKING]
I've gotta do my axe returns.
ພວກເຮົາຍັງຈະຂ້າພວກມັນ ຫຼືພວກມັນຈະຂ້າພວກເຮົາ! ມັນເປັນວິທີດຽວທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈະກໍາຈັດພວກມັນໄດ້
! ຖ້າພວກເຮົາຊອກຫາມານ ແລະທໍາລາຍມັນ, ພວກດຣາກອນຈະຫນີໄປ. ພວກມັນຈະຊອກຫາບ້ານອື່ນ.

112
00:08:54,450 --> 00:09:00,450
[STOICK]
Alright. Those who stay will look after Hiccup. Hands jut into the air, volunteers galore. Enthusiastic murmurs of prep and packing fill the room.
ໂຈມຕີທີ 8 ລະເບີດ Venom 12

113
00:09:00,950 --> 00:09:02,950
[PHLEGMA THE FIERCE]
To the ships!
ການສົນທະນາກ່ຽວກັບເລື່ອງນີ້ ຮູ້ສຶກວ່າເປັນເລື່ອງດຽວ.

114
00:09:03,450 --> 00:09:05,450
[SPITELOUT]
I'm with you Stoick!
ເອົາອັນນີ້, ມັນມີດອກໄມ້ຢູ່ເທິງມັນ. ເດັກຍິງມັກ ດອກໄມ້. Ruffnut
ໃຊ້ Shield ກັບ BASH Tuffnut ໃນໃບຫນ້າ. ລາວບໍ່ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ໄປ.

115
00:09:05,950 --> 00:09:11,950
[STOICK]
That's more like it. The Vikings rush for the door, leaving Gobber and Stoick alone. Gobber gulps back the contents of his tankard attachment and scrapes back the bench.
ກັບຄືນໄປບ່ອນນອນ, you overgrown sausage! ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບອີກໂອກາດຫນຶ່ງ
, ບໍ່ກັງວົນ. Slam! Lock. Gobber turns to the recruits.

116
00:09:12,450 --> 00:09:14,450
[GOBBER]
I'll pack my undies.
ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ເຄີຍລັກອາຫານ, ບໍ່ເຄີຍສະແດງຕົວເອງ, ແລະ
... ສຽງໄດ້ຖອຍໄປ, ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ catapult ບົກພ່ອງໃນໄຟ.

117
00:09:14,950 --> 00:09:18,800
[STOICK]
No, I need you to stay and train some new recruits.
Tuffnut, Ruffnut ເຈົ້າອອກແລ້ວ!

118
00:09:19,300 --> 00:09:25,300
[GOBBER]
Oh, perfect. And while I'm busy, Hiccup can cover the stall. Molten steel, razor sharp blades, lots of time to himself...what could possibly go wrong? Stoick sinks onto the bench beside Gobber, his brow burdened.
ສິ່ງທີ່?! Gronckle scoops up a heap of rocks and Swallows them back. the teenagers
gather on the far side of the ring. ພວກໄວລຸ້ນພາກັນເຕົ້າໂຮມກັນຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງຂອງວົງ.

119
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:28,950
[STOICK]
What am I going to do with him Gobber?
ສະນັ້ນ...ເປັນຫຍັງເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດ? ລາວປ່ອຍບານລົງ ແລະກົດໃສ່ໃນທິດທາງທີ່ມັນບິນໄປລາວຕົກລົງໄປໃນຮ່ອງຮອຍຫີນແລະຕິດຕາມມັນໄປຫາ... ຄອຍທີ່ໂດດດ່ຽວເຕັມໄປດ້ວຍສະລອຍນ້
ໍາ ຕົ້ນສະຫມຸນໄພທີ່ບໍລິສຸດລາວສະແກນຝາຫີນສູງ...ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນສັງເກດເຫັນ SCALE ສີດໍາດຽວຢູ່ເທິງພື້ນດິນລາວນັ່ງແລະເອົາມັນຂຶ້ນ, ສຶກສາມັນ

120
00:09:29,450 --> 00:09:31,900
[GOBBER]
Put him in training with the others.
ຂ້ອຍ... ຂ້ອຍຕ້ອງເວົ້າກັບເຈົ້າ, ພໍ່.

121
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:34,400
[STOICK]
No, I'm serious.
ມັນເຖິງເວລາແລ້ວ Hiccup.

122
00:09:34,900 --> 00:09:37,700
[GOBBER]
So am I. Stoick turns to him, glaring.
ນີ້ແມ່ນຄວາມຈິງ son! Stoick ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ axe ໃນມືຂອງ Hiccup ໄດ້.
ນໍ້າຫນັກຂອງມັນໄດ້ດຶງເຂົາລົງ. ລາວເບິ່ງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເຫັນ Stoick underlighted ກັບໄຟ.

123
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:42,750
[STOICK]
He'd be killed before you let the first dragon out of its cage.
ເປັນຫຍັງເຈົ້າຈຶ່ງບໍ່...ບິນໄປ? ON HICCUP ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາວເຫັນບັນຫາ. ລາວປັບຮູບແຕ້ມຂອງລາວ, ເອົາໃຈໃສ່ລຶບເຄິ່ງ ຫນຶ່ງ ຂອງຫອຍຂອງມ້າ. ລາວຜິດພາດຖິ້ມໄມ້ຖ່ານຫີນ.
ມັນລໍ້ລົງຈາກຫີນທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້ຈາກການເບິ່ງແລະໂດດລົງໄປໃນ cove. TINK. TInk. Tink. Night ຟິວຣີ ຍົກຫົວຂຶ້ນ, ເຫັນ Hiccup. ພວກເຂົາແລກປ່ຽນການເບິ່ງຢ່າງເລິກເຊິ່ງ, ບໍ່ຢ້ານ.

124
00:09:43,250 --> 00:09:45,250
[GOBBER]
Oh, you don't know that.
ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນ Hiccup)... ນີ້.

125
00:09:45,750 --> 00:09:47,750
[STOICK]
I do know that, actually.
ຂ້ອຍຜິດເວລາໃນການລອຍນໍ້າ summersault ຂອງຂ້ອຍ
ມັນບໍ່ສະຫມໍ່າສະເຫມີ ມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍຫລຸດຖອຍຫລັງ

126
00:09:48,250 --> 00:09:50,250
[GOBBER]
No, you don't.
Gronckles ແມ່ນແຂງແຮງ ການເອົາຫນຶ່ງໃນພວກມັນຈະແນ່ນອນໃຫ້ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າ girlfriend ເປັນ
stealthy, snakelike ຫົວ dragon peeks ຜ່ານ rooftop, ດູດແກັສເຂົ້າໄປໃນ chimney ໄດ້

127
00:09:50,750 --> 00:09:52,750
[STOICK]
No, actually I do.
ບໍ່, ບໍ່, ເຈົ້າດີເດັ່ນ.

128
00:09:53,250 --> 00:09:55,250
[GOBBER]
No you don't!
ພວກເຂົາພົບເຫັນແກະ!

129
00:09:55,750 --> 00:10:01,700
[STOICK]
Listen! You know what he's like. From the time he could crawl he's been...different. He doesn't listen.
ຢືນ. ວາງ. ມີ. ທ່ານຮູ້ສິ່ງທີ່ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຫມາຍຄວາມວ່າ. Gobber ບຸກເຂົ້າໄປໃນ
struggle ໄດ້, HULLERING. ກ່ຽວກັບ HICCUP, a smirk crosses his face.

130
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:08,200
[STOICK]
Has the attention span of a sparrow. I take him fishing and he goes hunting for... for trolls.
ກັບມາທີ່ນີ້!

131
00:10:08,700 --> 00:10:10,800
[GOBBER]
Trolls exist! They steal your socks.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ມັນມ່ວນພຽງແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບບາດແຜຈາກມັນ.

132
00:10:11,300 --> 00:10:13,300
[STOICK]
When I was a boy...
The Nadders have cornered the house-full of sheep. they close in, ready to jump on them. Stoick suddenly appears, HURRING FISHING NETS over them. The surprised
Nadders are caught. Stoic ແລະຄົນລາວແລ່ນເຂົ້າມາ. Nadder ໄດ້ລະເບີດຮູຜ່ານຕາຂ່າຍຂອງມັນ. Stoik ໂດດເຂົ້າມາ, ຈັບແຂນຫນາຂອງມັນອ້ອມຫົວຂອງມັນ, ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຕາກຂອງມັນປິດ.

133
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:15,800
[GOBBER]
Oh here we go.
ສະນັ້ນ ຂ້ອຍຄິດວ່າ ພວກເຮົາຈະແບ່ງປັນ...

134
00:10:16,300 --> 00:10:22,300
[STOICK]
My father told me to bang my head against a rock and I did it. I thought it was crazy, but I didn't question him. And you know what happened?
ມາ. ໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍມີຫຍັງຍິງ, ໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍ ມີຫຍັງຍິງ. ຄາບລາມ! ຫໍໂຄ້ງພັງລົງ. ການລະເບີດໄຟເຮັດໃຫ້ທາຣັກມີແສງສະຫວ່າງເປັນເວລາສິບວິນາທີ. Hiccup
ດຶງປືນ. KERTHUNK! ແຂນ flexed SNAP ຕໍ່ໄປ, springing ອາວຸດຈາກພື້ນດິນ. ບານຫາຍໄປໃນທ້ອງຟ້າ, ຕິດຕາມດ້ວຍ WHACK ແລະ ScreeCH.

135
00:10:22,800 --> 00:10:24,800
[GOBBER]
You got a headache.
ຍົກເວັ້ນທ່ານ, ໃນ STOICK, ຄວບຄຸມ Nadders ທີ່ຖືກເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ລາວໄດ້ຍິນສຽງຮ້ອງໄຫ້ທີ່ຄຸ້ນເຄີຍ ແລະເບິ່ງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເຫັນ..
. HICCUP ແລ່ນຜ່ານ Plaza, screaming, ກັບ Nightmare ໄວໃນ heel ຂອງເຂົາ. ຢ້ານກົວ, Stoick ປະຖິ້ມ Nadders ແລະແລ່ນອອກ.

136
00:10:25,300 --> 00:10:31,300
[STOICK]
That rock split in two. It taught me what a Viking could do, Gobber. He could crush mountains, level forests, tame seas! Even as a boy, I knew what I was, what I had to become.
ລາວບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກິນ... ແຕ່ວ່າພວກນາຍທະຫານໃຫມ່ຍັງສືບຕໍ່ປິດຊ່ອງຫວ່າງ
. ການລໍ້ຕາຂອງເຂົາ, Hiccup ນັ່ງຢູ່ໂຕະຫວ່າງຂ້າງເຂົາເຈົ້າ.

137
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:35,300
[GOBBER]
You can't stop him, Stoick. You can only prepare him.
ຢ່າປ່ອຍໃຫ້ເຂົາເຈົ້າຫນີ!

138
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:41,800
[ON AN OPEN NOTEBOOK]
"Dragon" DeBlois/Sanders Final Draft  02-13-2010 18. A drawn map of the island, covered in X's. Hiccup looks up from it and peeks over a gorge, expectantly. Sees nothing. He adds another 'X' to the page, then scratches his pencil over the whole map in frustration. He snaps the book closed and pockets it.
ສະນັ້ນ, ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຄິດວ່າມັນແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ທ່ານແລະຂ້າພະເຈົ້າ huh?

139
00:10:42,300 --> 00:10:48,300
[HICCUP]
Uggh, the gods hate me. Some people lose their knife or their mug. No, not me. I manage to lose an entire dragon. Hiccup WHACKS a low-hanging branch. It SNAPS back at him, hitting him in the face. He looks up to see a snapped tree trunk. His eyes follow it to a long trench of up-turned earth. He follows it to a downed, black dragon, its body and tail tangled in a bola. It appears dead. Hiccup approaches, beaming.
ທ່ານຫມົດຫມົດແລ້ວ ລາວຕີ Nightmare ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງໃນໃບຫນ້າ, ຂັບໄລ່ມັນໄປ
. ມັນຂຶ້ນອາກາດແລະຫາຍໄປ. ຫາຍໃຈ, Stoick ຫັນເປັນ Hiccup.

140
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:52,650
[HICCUP]
Oh wow. I did it. I did it. This fixes everything.
ດີ, ແຕ່ວ່າຂ້ອຍໄດ້ພົບກັບ Night ຟິວຣີ Stoick
ຈັບ Hiccup ຈາກດ້ານຫລັງຂອງຄໍຂອງລາວ ແລະດຶງລາວໄປ

141
00:10:53,150 --> 00:10:56,650
[HICCUP]
I have brought down this mighty beast! It suddenly shifts.
ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ຢາກຕໍ່ສູ້ກັບດຣາກອນ.

142
00:10:57,150 --> 00:11:03,150
[HICCUP]
Whoa! Hiccup springs back, terrified. He turns his blade on it. Rattled, Hiccup creeps along the length of the weak, wounded dragon, dagger poised to strike. As he reaches the head, Hiccup finds the Night Fury staring coldly at him. Hiccup tries to look away, but he's drawn back to its unnerving, unflinching stare. With the dragon safety tangled in the ropes, Hiccup jabs with his dagger, puffing himself up with false bravado.
ແຕ່ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ ຂ້ອຍຈະຍ້າຍໄປຢູ່ຊັ້ນໃຕ້ດິນຂອງພໍ່ແມ່ຂ້ອຍ ເຈົ້າຄວນຈະມາອອກກໍາລັງກາຍ ບາງຄັ້ງ ເຈົ້າເບິ່ງຄືວ່າເຈົ້າອອກກໍາລັງ
ກາຍ-- ນາງຂັບລົດອອກໄປຈາກທາງ, ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລູກປືນຍິງຜ່ານນາງ ແລະຍິງໃສ່ກ້ອງປ້ອງກັນຂອງ Snotlout.

143
00:11:03,650 --> 00:11:09,650
[HICCUP]
I'm going to kill you, Dragon. I'm gonna cut out your heart and take it to my father. I'm a Viking.
ແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານອອກໄປ, ໄພພິບັດຕິດຕາມ. ທ່ານບໍ່ເຫັນວ່າຂ້າພະເຈົ້າມີບັນຫາທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ?
ລະດູຫນາວເກືອບຈະມາເຖິງແລະຂ້າພະເຈົ້າມີບ້ານທັງຫມົດທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ອາຫານ! Hiccup ເບິ່ງອ້ອມຂ້າງ. ຕາທັງຫມົດແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນລາວ.

144
00:11:10,150 --> 00:11:16,150
[HICCUP]
I did this. He turns to leave. Pauses. And glances back at the dragon, chest heaving. Hiccup GRUMBLES. He checks over his shoulder to ensure that no one is watching... then hurries back to cut the ropes. The Night Fury's eye shoots open. With the dragon watching his every move, Hiccup hurriedly saws through the bola ropes. As the last rope falls free, the Night Fury suddenly POUNCES! In a blur, the dragon is upon him, pinning Hiccup down, grazing his neck. Looking like it's about to kill him. Hiccup is paralyzed. The dragon's breath ruffles his hair. Hiccup opens his eyes to find the Night Fury's wolf-like stare boring into him. The exchange is intense, profound. The dragon draws a deep breath, as though it's about to torch him, then lets out an ear-piercing scream instead. It turns and takes flight, flapping violently through the canopy of trees. It bashes against a nearby mountain side, recovers, and drops out of view some distance away. Winded, Hiccup struggles to his feet, staggers a few steps, collapses to his knees, and faints.
ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄວາມຕະຫລົກ, Hiccup!

145
00:11:16,650 --> 00:11:18,650
[STOICK]
Hiccup.
ທ່ານເປັນຫຼາຍຢ່າງ, Hiccup. ແຕ່ຜູ້ຂ້າມມ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນຫນຶ່ງໃນນັ້ນ
. Hickup ເບິ່ງອ້ອມຂ້າງເພື່ອເບິ່ງຫຼາຍ nods ຂອງຂໍ້ຕົກລົງ.

