Hiccup! She puts her finger to her lips and gestures for him to hide. A moment later, the Nadder leaps over the walls, surprising them by landing in front of her. Astrid somersaults into its blind spot, confusing it. She rears back to strike -- just as Snotlout LEAPS IN, protectively SWEEPING Astrid behind him.
ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າດີ. ຫຼາຍ Terrible Terrors ລົງ like seagulls, hissing ແລະ nipping at each other as they approach Toothless' pile of fish. ຫນຶ່ງ grabs the regurgitated fish head and drags it away. ອີກຄົນ ຫນຶ່ງ ພະຍາຍາມທີ່ຈະລັກເອົາມັນຈາກລາວ
. ພວກເຂົາປະເຊີນຫນ້າກັບກັນແລະບານໄຟສຸດທ້າຍໃນກັນແລະກັນເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂການຕໍ່ສູ້. Hiccup ແລະToothless ເບິ່ງ, ມ່ວນຊື່ນ. ນັ້ນແມ່ນຈົນກ່ວາ... Toothles spots ຫນຶ່ງໃນປາຂອງເຂົາອອກຈາກ pile ໄດ້. ເປັນ stealthy Terrible Terror ຖືກ

286
00:22:12,850 --> 00:22:15,650
[SNOTLOUT]
Watch out babe. I'll take care of this.
ອິອິ. ມັນເປັນປີກແລະຊອຍທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການແທ້ໆ
ຖ້າມັນບໍ່ສາມາດບິນໄດ້ ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດຫນີໄດ້.

287
00:22:16,150 --> 00:22:18,600
[ASTRID]
Hey! Snotlout MISSES. Astrid glares at him.
ມັນຈະເປັນຂ້ອຍ.

288
00:22:19,100 --> 00:22:25,100
[SNOTLOUT]
The sun was in my eyes, Astrid. What do you want me to do, block out the sun? I could do that, but I don't have time right now! The Nadder tears off after her, knocking down walls in pursuit. She leaps and dives like a highly trained gymnast. Hiccup wanders up to Gobber again.
ໂອ້ພະເຈົ້າ! ໂອ້ບໍ່! ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການ Hiccup,
ຮອຍຄໍສູນເສຍການຄວບຄຸມ. Hickup ແລະ Toothless spiral ລົງໄປ.

289
00:22:25,600 --> 00:22:31,550
[HICCUP]
They probably take the daytime off. You know, like a cat. Has anyone ever seen one napping?
Hiccup
ຂອງຄວາມສຸກປ່ຽນໄປເປັນຄວາມຢ້ານກົວໃນຂະນະທີ່ພວກເຂົາບິນໂດຍກົງເຂົ້າໄປໃນມັນ.

290
00:22:32,050 --> 00:22:34,050
[GOBBER]
Hiccup!
Uh..ບໍ່ຂອບໃຈ.

291
00:22:34,550 --> 00:22:40,550
[ASTRID]
--Hiccup! Hiccup spins around to see the maze walls collapsing like dominos toward him. Astrid comes flying through the dust and crash-lands on top of him, laying him out in a limb-tangled mess.
ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນເກາະນີ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຮູ້ກ່ຽວກັບມັນ.

292
00:22:41,050 --> 00:22:43,050
[TUFFNUT]
Oooh! Love on the battlefield!
ໂອ້?

293
00:22:43,550 --> 00:22:48,450
[RUFFNUT]
She could do better. The Nadder closes in, emerging through the cloud of dust.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ເດັກນ້ອຍ! ແມ່ນແລ້ວ! ໂອ້, ນີ້ຫນ້າປະຫລາດໃຈ!
ລົມໃນຂ້າພະເຈົ້າ... ລາວເຫັນຄູ່ມືຫນັງ tearing ປ່ອຍໃນ turbulence ໄດ້.

294
00:22:48,950 --> 00:22:54,950
[HICCUP]
Just... let me... why don't you... The Nadder spins around and races back toward them like a Raptor. Astrid untangles herself and tries to pull her axe from Hiccup's shield... which is attached to his limp, gangly arm. She PLANTS her foot on his torso and YANKS the axe free, still burrowed into the shield.
ໂອ້ພະເຈົ້າ. ພໍ່ຂ້ອຍຂໍໂທດຫຼາຍ. ຂ້ອຍກໍາລັງຈະບອກເຈົ້າ. ແຕ່ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ຮູ້ວິທີ--
Stoick ເລີ້ມຫັວເຣາະ. ໃຫຍ່, booming. Hiccup stares, puzzled.

295
00:22:55,450 --> 00:23:01,450
[GOBBER]
Well done, Astrid. Gobber hobbles off to wrestle the Nadder back into his cave. Hiccup gets to his feet -- all eyes are upon him. He turns to find Astrid glaring at him, winded.
ສິ່ງທີ່?! ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຫວັງສໍາລັບນີ້!

296
00:23:01,950 --> 00:23:07,950
[ASTRID]
Is this some kind of a joke to you? Our parents' war is about to become ours. Figure out which side you're on. She grabs her axe and stomps off. Hiccup watches, stung.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ! ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ມັນໄດ້ຜົນ! ໄຊຊະນະມີອາຍຸບໍ່ດົນ. ພວກເຂົາໄດ້ຕີກັນໃນຫນຶ່ງໃນຫຼາຍໆທະເລ
stacks ໃນຂະນະທີ່ Hiccup ພະຍາຍາມທີ່ຈະຕິດຕາມກັບ turns ໄດ້.

297
00:23:08,450 --> 00:23:14,450
[CLOSE ON]
A fish... being thrown into the cove. It hits the ground and slides. A moment later, Hiccup peeks through a gap in the rock, looking around cautiously. Nothing. Hiccup squeezes through and enters the cove. A BEAT, then Hiccup hears a SNORT from behind him. Hiccup turns to see the Night Fury, crouched on a rock like a stealthy panther. It descends, approaching him... ready to pounce. Hiccup swallows his fear and offers the fish. Doing so reveals the dagger at his waist. The dragon sees it and hisses. Hiccup reaches for it, eliciting a growl. He pauses, carefully lifts it by the handle, and tosses it away. The dragon calms. As it approaches the fish, Hiccup notices that it's missing teeth.
(ເວົ້າກ່ຽວກັບແຕ່ລະຄົນ) ເວົ້າກ່ຽວກັບທຸກໆຄົນ

298
00:23:14,950 --> 00:23:20,950
[HICCUP]
Huh. Toothless. I could've sworn you had... A set of razor sharp teeth emerge from its gums to grab the fish. Toothless snatches and gnashes it up, swallowing it.
ຂ້ອຍຮູ້ແລ້ວ, ຂ້ອຍຮູ້, ແຕ່ໃນທາງທິດສະດີ...

299
00:23:21,450 --> 00:23:27,050
[HICCUP]
... teeth. The teeth retract again. Toothless presses closer with an expectant look. Hiccup retreats nervously.
ເຮືອອື່ນໆຢູ່ໃສ?

300
00:23:27,550 --> 00:23:33,550
[HICCUP]
Uh, no. No, I don't have any more. The Fury backs Hiccup against a rock, placing himself the same position as before. The dragon closes in over him, staring blankly. A tense moment passes... then Toothless regurgitates a chunk of fish onto Hiccup's lap. They exchange stares. Hiccup realizes what Toothless wants him to do. Hiccup crouches slowly and squeamishly picks it up. The dragon waits expectantly. Hiccup gags and gnaws off a bite of the slimy fish. He forces a smile. Toothless mimics him. Amazed, Hiccup sits up and tries to touch him. Toothless HISSES and flaps off to a crash on the other side of the cove. He BLASTS the mossy ground to a red-hot temperature... and curls up on it like a giant dog. He turns to find Hiccup seated beside him. Toothless tolerates his persistent presence... until Hiccup tries to touch his damaged tail. Toothless SNAPS at him. Hiccup takes the hint and leaves.
ເຮີ້!

301
00:23:34,050 --> 00:23:40,050
[GOBBER]
...and with one twist he took my hand and swallowed it whole. And I saw the look on his face.  I was delicious. He must have passed the word, because it wasn't a month before another one of them took my leg.
ລາວໂດດຜ່ານພື້ນຜິວຂອງນ້ ໍາ ແລະອາບນ້ ໍາ. ໂດຍບໍ່ມີ Hiccup ທີ່ຈະຄວບຄຸມຊອຍ, Toothless ເຮັດຄືກັນ,
ລົງໄປໃນລູກປືນຂະ ຫນາດ ໃຫຍ່. Hickup resurfaces, rough up, ແຕ່ສ່ອງແສງ. ບໍ່ມີແຂ້ວປາກົດຂື້ນສອງວິນາທີຕໍ່ມາ.

302
00:23:40,550 --> 00:23:46,550
[FISHLEGS]
Isn't it weird to think that your hand was inside a dragon. Like if your mind was still in control of it you could have killed the dragon from the inside by crushing his heart or something.
ແລະເຊື່ອຂ້ອຍ, ມັນພຽງແຕ່ຈະດີຂຶ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ
ລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າເຈົ້າຈະຖອກທ້ອງຂອງ Nadder ເປັນຄັ້ງທໍາອິດ.

303
00:23:47,050 --> 00:23:53,050
[SNOTLOUT]
I swear I'm so angry right now. I'll avenge your beautiful hand and your beautiful foot. I'll chop off the legs of every dragon I fight, with my face. He postures to Astrid. She rolls her eyes.
ມື້ນີ້ແມ່ນກ່ຽວກັບການເຮັດວຽກເປັນທີມ. ເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນແລະທ່ານອາດຈະລອດຊີວິດ. ໃນປະຕູທີ່ກວ້າງສອງເທົ່າ. ອາຍແກັສຮົ່ວໄຫລຜ່ານຮ່ອງຮອຍ. ມັນລະເບີດເປີດ.
ຟ້າຂອງຄວັນສູບກວມເອົາວົງ, ຫມູນວຽນອ້ອມຮອບໄວລຸ້ນທີ່ຄູ່ກັນ. Astrid ກັບ Ruffnut. Snotlout ກັບ Tuffnut. Fishlegs ກັບ Hiccup. ທຸກຄົນຖືຖັງນ້ ໍາ, ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຖິ້ມພວກມັນ.

304
00:23:53,550 --> 00:23:59,550
[GOBBER]
Un-unh. It's the wings and the tails you really want. If it can't fly, it can't get away. A downed dragon is a dead dragon.
ທ່ານໄດ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າໄປທີ່ນັ້ນແທ້ໆ, ລູກຊາຍ. ທຸກປີຂອງ Viking Berk ທີ່ຮ້າຍແຮງທີ່ສຸດທີ່ເຄີຍເຫັນ! Odin,
ມັນແມ່ນຮຸນແຮງ. ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າເກືອບຈະຍອມແພ້ທ່ານ! Hiccup ໄດ້ກັບຄືນໄປບ່ອນ, grimacing ໃນ irony ຂອງມັນທັງຫມົດ.

305
00:24:00,050 --> 00:24:06,050
[GOBBER]
Alright. I'm off to bed. You should be too. Tomorrow we get into the big boys. Slowly but surely making our way up to the Monstrous Nightmare.  But who'll win the honor of killing it? He hobbles off. The teens reflect.
ຄວາມເປັນໄປໄດ້ໃນການລອດຊີວິດ ແມ່ນຫຼຸດລົງໄປສູ່ຕົວເລກດຽວ ດຽວນີ້...

306
00:24:06,550 --> 00:24:08,550
[TUFFNUT]
It's gonna be me.
ບໍ່ເຄີຍປະເຊີນຫນ້າກັບ Dragon ນີ້. ໂອກາດດຽວຂອງທ່ານ, ເຊື່ອງໄວ້ແລະອະທິຖານບໍ່ໃຫ້ມັນພົບທ່ານ. Hiccup ດຶງຫນັງສື sketchbook ຂອງເຂົາອອກຈາກ vest
ຂອງເຂົາແລະເປີດມັນເພື່ອການແຕ້ມຮູບຂອງ Toothless ຂອງເຂົາ. ລາວວາງມັນໃນຫນ້າຫວ່າງຂອງປື້ມແລະພິຈາລະນາມັນ. ໃກ້ກັບການແຕ່ງຮູບຂອງ toothless...

307
00:24:09,050 --> 00:24:11,500
[FISHLEGS]
Your mom let you get a tattoo?
Ahhhhh. ກັບທ່ານເຮັດໄດ້ດີໃນວົງການ, ພວກເຮົາໃນທີ່ສຸດມີບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງທີ່ຈະສົນທະນາກ່ຽວກັບ. ການຢຸດເຊົາຖືພາ. Hiccup
ຫັນສາຍຕາຂອງພຣະອົງ nervously. Stoick ປັບຕົວ, clearing ຄໍ awkwardly. ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ຍາວນານ, silence ບໍ່ສະດວກສະບາຍ...

308
00:24:12,000 --> 00:24:14,450
[TUFFNUT]
It's not a tattoo. It's a birthmark.
ເອົາພວກເຮົານໍາເຮືອໄປສູ່ຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ
ຜູ້ຊາຍໄດ້ຖອດອາວຸດ, ກຽມພ້ອມສໍາລັບອັນຮ້າຍແຮງທີ່ສຸດ.

309
00:24:14,950 --> 00:24:19,850
[RUFFNUT]
Okay, I've been stuck with you since birth, and that was never there before.
ດີງຽບລົງ. ຜູ້ເຖົ້າໄດ້ຕັດສິນໃຈ. ມີຄວາມຕື່ນເຕັ້ນ, Gobber ຢືນຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ Hiccup ແລະ Astrid. ລາວຊີ້ໃຫ້ Astrid ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຝູງຊົນລໍຖ້າຢ່າງງຽບສະຫງົບ. Gothi ຂັບຫົວ'ບໍ່'
. ຝູງຊົນ'Oooohs.' Gobber ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຊີ້ໄປຫາ Hickup. ຜູ້ ເຖົ້າຍິ້ມຫົວຢືນຢັນ'ແມ່ນແລ້ວ'. ຝຸງຊົນລະເບີດໃນການຊົມເຊີຍ. Astrid turns a boiling, deathly gaze on

310
00:24:20,350 --> 00:24:25,250
[TUFFNUT]
Yes it was. You've just never seen me from the left side until now.
"Dragon" DeBlois/Sanders Final Draft 02-13-2010 34. ທັນທີມີແສງສະຫວ່າງ.
ຮູບຊົງຂອງດາວໂຫຼດ. ຮ້ອງໄຫ້. ສຽງຂອງໄມ້ແຕກແລະແຕກຫັກ. ຕົກລົງໃນນ້ ໍາ. ແສງທີ່ສົດໃສອີກຄັ້ງ.

311
00:24:25,750 --> 00:24:31,750
[SNOTLOUT]
It wasn't there yesterday. Is it a birthmark or a today-mark? Hiccup gets up and walks away from the group. Astrid watches him as he leaves the bonfire.
ສຸມ Hiccup! ທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ພະຍາຍາມ. Cut ກັບຄືນໄປບ່ອນເພື່ອເປີດເຜີຍ Nadder ອັນຕະລາຍ,
lossy ໃນການຈັດຕັ້ງທີ່ຄ້າຍຄື labyrinth ຂອງກໍາແພງເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍ. Gobber ເອີ້ນຄໍາສັ່ງຈາກເທິງ.

312
00:24:32,250 --> 00:24:38,250
[CLOSE ON]
... a creaking leather bellows. The stone forge glows with every pump. Tongs pull intricate iron pieces from the coals. They're dropped onto the anvil, twisted, lightly hammered, and dunked in a barrel. The pieces are carried to Hiccup's workbench and laid out in place on a one-to-one schematic. It's a sketch of a mechanical fin.
ມັນບໍ່ມີມື້ວານນີ້. ມັນເປັນຮອຍເກີດຫລືຮອຍໃນມື້ນີ້ບໍ? Hiccup
ລຸກຂຶ້ນແລະຍ່າງອອກຈາກກຸ່ມ. Astrid ສັງເກດເບິ່ງລາວເມື່ອລາວອອກຈາກໄຟ

313
00:24:38,750 --> 00:24:44,750
[HICCUP]
Hey Toothless. I brought breakfast. I hope you're hungry. Hiccup drops the basket and kicks it over. Fish spill out.
ທ່ານໄດ້ຮັກສາຄວາມລັບ, ຂາຂອງ Hiccup
ໄດ້ລົ້ມ, ລາວລອຍ, ດຶງເນື້ອໃນຂອງໂຕະກັບເຂົາ.

314
00:24:45,250 --> 00:24:49,100
[HICCUP]
Okay, that's disgusting. Toothless approaches, settling in to devour the feast.
ຜິດພາດຂອງຂ້າພະເຈົ້າ. Toothless hits ລາວດ້ວຍແຜ່ນ'ຫູ' ຂອງຕົນ.

315
00:24:49,600 --> 00:24:52,050
[HICCUP]
Uh..we've got some salmon... Toothless swallows it.
ສະບາຍດີ Toothless ຂ້ອຍໄດ້ນໍາເອົາອາຫານເຊົ້າ
ຂ້ອຍຫວັງວ່າເຈົ້າອຶດຫິວ Hiccup ຖິ້ມກະຕ່າລົງແລະຕີມັນປາໄຫຼອອກ

316
00:24:52,550 --> 00:24:55,350
[HICCUP]
... some nice Icelandic cod... Swallows those too.
ກະລຸນາ, ດ້ວຍວິທີໃດກໍຕາມ. ນາງdarts off, CLOSING
ຢ່າງໄວວາກ່ຽວກັບ Dragon ໄດ້. ຝູງຊົນຂ້າງເທິງ cheers ສໍາລັບນາງ.

317
00:24:55,850 --> 00:25:01,850
[HICCUP]
... and a whole smoked eel. Toothless nabs it, chews a few times, then spits it out. He shakes his head violently, snorts and scrubs his massive tongue on the sand. Hiccup takes note.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ!

318
00:25:02,350 --> 00:25:08,350
[HICCUP]
No, no, no! It's okay. Yeah, I don't like eel much either. Toothless focuses on the remainder. With the dragon distracted, Hiccup unwraps his prosthetic fin and opens it like a fan.
...ໃນຂະນະທີ່ນາງໄດ້ຫາຍໃຈຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫລັງຂອງຂີດຂວາງ
. ນາງສັ່ນຕອງ, ສຸມໃສ່, ຕັດສິນໃຈ.

319
00:25:08,850 --> 00:25:14,850
[HICCUP]
Okay. That's it. That's it, just stick with good stuff. And don't you mind me. I'll just be back...here. Minding my own business. Hiccup cautiously approaches the injured tail, but every time he gets near it, Toothless sweeps it away like a cat.
ຊຸດທີ່ເຫມາະສົມ ເຮັດໃຫ້ນາງໃກ້ຊິດ, ເຈົ້າຮູ້ບໍ່
? ຕາ Hiccup helmet ທີ່ບໍ່ເຫມາະກັນ, grimacing.

320
00:25:15,350 --> 00:25:21,350
[HICCUP]
It's okay. Hiccup drops a knee on top of the tail. Toothless' head juts up, slows its chewing to a halt.
Gobber ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້, ສະນັ້ນ... ລາວເອົາໂພຊັ່ນແບບບໍ່ສະບາຍໆ
, ພະຍາຍາມປົກປິດຫຼາຍເທົ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້.

321
00:25:21,850 --> 00:25:27,850
[HICCUP]
Okay...okay.. The dragon tenses, slowly spreading his wings. Hiccup straps the prosthetic fin in place. He cinches the straps.
ບໍ່ແມ່ນວ່າມີຫຍັງຜິດກັບຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ Dragon Astrid
Elbows Snotlout ໃນໃບຫນ້າ Ruffnut Drop Tuffnut ກັບ Punch ໃນຄໍ

322
00:25:28,350 --> 00:25:34,350
[HICCUP]
There. Not too bad. It works. Toothless BOLTS! He snaps his massive wings and takes to the air, carrying Hiccup with him.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ ແມ່ນແລ້ວ ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ສາມາດລໍຖ້າໄດ້ ຂ້ອຍແມ່ນ...

323
00:25:34,850 --> 00:25:40,850
[HICCUP]
Woah! No! No! No! Hiccup struggles to hold on to the tail. As the ground speeds away, Toothless immediately TIPS into a uncontrolled bank and dive. Hiccup sees the folded fin rattling uselessly in opposition to its flared counterpart. Flap as he may, Toothless can't correct his trajectory.
ເຈົ້າຄິດວ່າເຈົ້າຈະໄປໃສ?

324
00:25:41,350 --> 00:25:46,600
[HICCUP]
It's working! Toothless arcs just short of the water and climbs... high into the air.
ຫຼຸດລົງ! ແລ່ນ!ແລ່ນ! Astrid ດຶງ axe
ຂອງນາງ, ກຽມພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຮັບເອົາ Toothless.

325
00:25:47,100 --> 00:25:53,100
[HICCUP]
Yes! Yes, I did it. He glances back at Hiccup, busily holding the tail open while trying to hold on. They're going to crash. Whoomp! Hiccup is suddenly thrown from the tail in the intense force of a turn.
ດຽວນີ້ເອົາຂ້ອຍລົງ.

326
00:25:53,600 --> 00:25:59,600
[AAAAAGGGGHHHHH!]
He bounces across the water's surface and takes a dive. Without Hiccup to operate the tail, Toothless does the same, plunging in a massive cannonball. Hiccup resurfaces, roughed up, but beaming. Toothless appears seconds later.
ໂອ, ດີເລີດ.

327
00:26:00,100 --> 00:26:02,100
[HICCUP]
Yeah!
ເຫັນບໍ່? ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງຕ້ອງຢ້ານ. Toothless ຢ່າງກະທັນຫັນ LAUNCHS ໂດຍກົງຂຶ້ນ. Astrid screams. ການເລັ່ງແມ່ນ tremendous. ທຸກໆ downbeat bucks the saddle, rocketing
ໃຫ້ເຂົາເຈົ້າຂຶ້ນສູ່ສະຫວັນ, doubling ຄວາມໄວຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າຄືກັບລູກສອນໄຟ Astrid ຖືກຖິ້ມກັບຄືນໄປບ່ອນ. ນາງ screams ແລະ hugs Hiccup ສໍາລັບຊີວິດ dear, squeezing ຫາຍໃຈອອກຈາກເຂົາ.

328
00:26:02,600 --> 00:26:08,600
[GOBBER]
Today is about teamwork. Work together and you might survive. ON A DOUBLE-WIDE DOOR. Gas seeps through the cracks. It BLASTS OPEN. A cloud of smoke engulfs the ring, swirling around the paired-up teens. Astrid with Ruffnut. Snotlout with Tuffnut. Fishlegs with Hiccup. All carry buckets of water, poised to throw them.
ໂອ້, ມາ!

329
00:26:09,100 --> 00:26:15,100
[GOBBER]
Now, a wet dragon head can't light its fire. The Hideous Zippleback is extra tricky. One head breathes gas, the other head lights it. Your job is to know which is which.
ຄັ້ງນີ້, ຄັ້ງນີ້ແນ່ນອນ.

330
00:26:15,600 --> 00:26:21,550
[FISHLEGS]
Razor sharp, serrated teeth that inject venom for pre-digestion. Prefers ambush attack, crushing its victims in its...
Hiccup! beat. the Zippleback hesitates. SNIFFS. then retreats. the teenagers get on
their feet, watching transfixed. Gobber peeks through his fingers to see... ຮີຮີຮິ ຮິຮິ

331
00:26:22,050 --> 00:26:24,050
[HICCUP]
Will you please stop that?
ພຽງແຕ່... ໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍ... ເປັນຫຍັງເຈົ້າ... ບໍ່ໃຫ້ Nadder ຫມູນວຽນແລະແລ່ນກັບມາຫາພວກເຂົາຄືກັບ Raptor Astrid untangles ຕົນເອງແລະພະຍາຍາມດຶງ axe ຂອງນາງຈາກ
shield ຂອງ Hiccup ໄດ້... ທີ່ຕິດກັບແຂນທີ່ອ່ອນແອ, gangly ຂອງເຂົາ. ນາງວາງຕີນຂອງນາງກ່ຽວກັບ torso ຂອງເຂົາແລະ YANKS axe ປ່ອຍ, ຍັງຂຸດເຂົ້າໃນ shield ໄດ້.

332
00:26:24,550 --> 00:26:30,500
[ON SNOTLOUT AND TUFFNUT]
Moving nervously through the fog, back to back. Snotlout is singing to himself to calm his nerves.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ກັບໄປໃນຄຸກຂອງທ່ານ Hiccup cleverly ເປີດ vest ຂອງຕົນ, ເປີດໃຫ້ເຫັນ EEL
smoked spotted ຈາກກ່ອນຫນ້ານີ້ລາວຖິ້ມມັນເຂົ້າໄປໃນປະຕູ, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ SLAMS ມັນປິດ

333
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:37,000
[SNOTLOUT]
If that dragon shows either of his faces, I'm gonna--  --There! Snotlout and Tuffnut HURL their water into the fog.
ຂ້ອຍ... ໄດ້ບໍ?

334
00:26:37,500 --> 00:26:39,500
[ASTRID]
Hey!
ບໍ່!

335
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:42,800
[RUFFNUT]
It's us, idiots. Astrid and Ruffnut are soaked.
ມັນເປັນເລື່ອງຕະຫລົກສໍາລັບເຈົ້າບໍ? ສົງຄາມຂອງພໍ່ແມ່ຂອງພວກເຮົາ ກໍາ
ລັງຈະກາຍເປັນຂອງພວກເຮົາຍັງຄິດວ່າເຈົ້າຢູ່ເບື້ອງໃດ. ນາງຈັບຫມອນແລະຍ່າງອອກໄປ. Hiccup ເບິ່ງ, ດັກ.

336
00:26:43,300 --> 00:26:47,150
[TUFFNUT]
Your butts are getting bigger. We thought you were a dragon.
ແມ່ນແຕ່ບໍ່ໃກ້ຊິດ.

337
00:26:47,650 --> 00:26:53,650
[SNOTLOUT]
Not that there's anything wrong with a dragon-esque figure. Astrid ELBOWS Snotlout in the face. Ruffnut DROPS Tuffnut with a PUNCH to the throat.
ຮາ. ບໍ່ມີແຂ້ວ. ຂ້ອຍສາມາດສາບານວ່າເຈົ້າມີ...
ແຂ້ວທີ່ແກະສະຫຼັກອອກມາຈາກແຂ້ວຂອງມັນ ເພື່ອຈັບປາ

338
00:26:54,150 --> 00:26:59,750
[ASTRID]
Wait. They FREEZE. A tail SWEEPS out of the fog, taking them down. Their buckets spill.
...ແລະຫມູທີ່ຖືກສູບທັງ ຫມົດ. Hiccup ໄດ້ສັງເກດເຫັນ
. ແລະໃນຕອນນີ້, Hickup ໄດ້ພົບເຫັນວ່າ:

339
00:27:00,250 --> 00:27:03,050
[TUFFNUT]
Oh, I'm hurt. I am very much hurt.
Toothless! ມີຫຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນ? ມັນເປັນຫຍັງ? Touthless Barks ກັບເຂົາ
.'ສະຫງົບ!' ໃນທັນທີ, ຈາກເມກຫນາແຫນ້ນ, nightmare monstrous emerges.

340
00:27:03,550 --> 00:27:06,700
[FISHLEGS]
Chances of survival are dwindling into single digits now...
ດີ, ຖ້າວ່າຄວາມສໍາເລັດຫມາຍຄວາມວ່າບັນຫາການເປັນພໍ່ແມ່ຂອງເຈົ້າຫມົດແລ້ວ
, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ... ແມ່ນແລ້ວ. Stoick ຢຸດເຊົາ. ຫມາຍຄວາມວ່າແນວໃດ?

341
00:27:07,200 --> 00:27:13,200
[HICCUP]
Look out! A Zippleback head emerges out of the smoke. Fishlegs hurls his water at it, completely dousing the head. It leers and opens its mouth, spewing gas into the area.
ໂອເຄ. ນັ້ນແມ່ນມັນ. ພຽງແຕ່ຍຶດກັບສິ່ງທີ່ດີ. ແລະບໍ່ສົນໃຈຂ້ອຍ. ຂ້ອຍຈະກັບຄືນມາ... ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້. ເບິ່ງແຍງວຽກຂອງຂ້ອຍເອງ.
Hiccup ລະມັດລະວັງເຂົ້າໃກ້ກັບຊ້າງທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບບາດເຈັບ, ແຕ່ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ລາວເຂົ້າໃກ້ມັນ, Toothless sweeping ມັນໄປຄືກັບແມວ.

342
00:27:13,700 --> 00:27:18,250
[FISHLEGS]
Oh. Wrong head. GAS FLOWS around their legs. Fishlegs flees in a panic.
ມີຫຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນ?

343
00:27:18,750 --> 00:27:23,650
[GOBBER]
Fishlegs! Beat. A clicking sound comes from behind them. Sparks flash in the smoke.
...aaaaaaauGGGGGGHHHHHH! ບໍ່!ບໍ່! Hiccup
ຍິ້ມຂາ, ບໍ່ພໍໃຈກັບສະຖານະການເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບນາງ.

344
00:27:24,150 --> 00:27:30,150
[GOBBER]
Now, Hiccup! The other head sweeps out of the smoke. Hiccup hurls his water with all his might. It arcs and drops short of the dragon's sparking mouth. The dragon grins, savoring the kill.
ມັນເບິ່ງຄືວ່າພວກມັນກໍາລັງຂັບເອົາສັດລ້ຽງຂອງພວກມັນ
Zippleback ໄດ້ເບິ່ງພວກມັນຢ່າງຫິວ.

345
00:27:30,650 --> 00:27:32,650
[HICCUP]
Oh, come on!
ໂອເຄ...ໂອເຄ...ດາວມັງກຣ tense, ຄ່ອຍໆເປີດປີກຂອງຕົນ
Hiccup straps the prosthetic fin in place.

346
00:27:33,150 --> 00:27:35,150
[RUN, HICCUP!]
Gobber COVERS his eyes.
Woah! ບໍ່! ບໍ່! ບໍ່ມີ! Hiccup ພະຍາຍາມທີ່ຈະຍຶດເອົາຄໍ. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພື້ນທີ່ເລັ່ງໄປ, Toothless ທັນທີ TIPS ເຂົ້າໄປໃນທະນາຄານທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຄວບຄຸມແລະ dive. Hickup
ເຫັນ fin folded rattling ບໍ່ເປັນປະໂຫຍດໃນກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ counterpart flared ຂອງຕົນ. Flap ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າລາວຈະໄດ້, toothless ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂເສັ້ນທາງຂອງຕົນ.

347
00:27:35,650 --> 00:27:41,650
[GOBBER]
Hiccup! Beat. The Zippleback hesitates. SNIFFS. Then retreats. The teens get to their feet, watching transfixed. Gobber peeks through his fingers to see...
ສຽງ CLACK ສຽງດັງອອກມາ. ຈາກຝູງຊົນຂ້າງເທິງ, Gothi, ຜູ້ເຖົ້າແກ່ຂອງບ້ານ
, ກ້າວໄປຂ້າງ ຫນ້າ, ແຕະຄໍຂອງນາງ. ທຸກຄົນຈະສົດໃສດ້ວຍຄວາມຕື່ນເຕັ້ນ.

348
00:27:42,150 --> 00:27:48,150
[HICCUP]
BACK! BACK! BACK! Now don't you make me tell you again! The Zippleback retreats through its door and into its cave, hissing.
ຫມູ່ບ້ານກໍາລັງຈັດງານລ້ຽງເພື່ອສະເຫຼີມສະຫຼອງ! Stoick ແມ່ນ
stunned, overwhelmed ໂດຍຄວາມບໍ່ມີຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກ. ລາວຫັນໄປຫາ Gobber.

349
00:27:48,650 --> 00:27:54,650
[HICCUP]
Yes, that's right. Back into your cage. Hiccup slyly OPENS his vest, revealing the spotted smoked EEL from earlier. He TOSSES it inside the door, then SLAMS it shut.
ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍໂອກາດອະທິບາຍ.

350
00:27:55,150 --> 00:28:00,750
[HICCUP]
Now think about what you've done. Hiccup turns to the teens and Gobber. They stare, slack-jawed
ສິ່ງ ທີ່ ເຮັດ ໃຫ້ ພວກ ເຮົາ ເປັນ ແນວ ໃດ? ພວກ ດຣາກອນ ບັງ ແລະ ລອຍ ລົງ ໃນ ການ ສ້າງ ຕັ້ງ, ຕົກ ລົງ ໂດຍ ຜ່ານ ຄວັນ ທີ່ ຫນາ ແຫນ້ນ ແລະ ຜູກ ພັນ ລະ ຫວ່າງ ພື້ນ ທະ ເລ ທີ່ ຍິ່ງ ໃຫຍ່, ແຄບ. ພວກ ເຂົາ ເຈົ້າ ອອກ ມາ
ຢູ່ ໃຕ້ ພື້ນ ຖານ ຂອງ ພູ ໄຟ volcanic massive caldera, glowing ກັບ rivulets ຂອງ lava. ຝູງ ຂອງ dragons ຕົກ ເປັນ ລໍາ ດັບ, funneling ຜ່ານ cracks, ແລະ zipping ຜ່ານ ທ່າມົນ. ມັນ ເຮັດ ໃຫ້ ມີ ຫ້ອງ ພາຍ ໃນ ກ

351
00:28:01,250 --> 00:28:07,250
[HICCUP]
Okay! So are we done? Because I've got some things I need to... Hiccup jogs out of the ring, past the speechless group.
ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຕໍ່ມາ, Gobber ຈັບ Hiccup
ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາວພະຍາຍາມທີ່ຈະອອກຈາກ.

352
00:28:07,750 --> 00:28:10,550
[HICCUP]
Yep...see you tomorrow. Astrid SNEERS. Something's going on.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ...ຕອນແລງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. ແຕ່ໃຜສາມາດຖິ້ມໂທດໃສ່ລາວໄດ້? ຂ້ອຍຫມາຍຄວາມວ່າ ຊີວິດຂອງຜູ້ທີ່ມີຊື່ສຽງແມ່ນຍາກຫຼາຍ
. ລາວບໍ່ສາມາດຍ່າງຜ່ານບ້ານໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຖືກແຟນໆໃຫມ່ຂອງລາວ. Stoick ມີຄວາມສັບສົນສອງເທົ່າ.

353
00:28:11,050 --> 00:28:13,050
[HICCUP]
Hey!
ບໍ່ໄວປານໃດ.

354
00:28:13,550 --> 00:28:15,550
[HICCUP]
Yeah! Whoa!
ມີຫຍັງຊ້າ ສໍາ ລັບຫຍັງແທ້ໆ Stoick
ສະເຫນີມືຂອງລາວເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຝູງຊົນທີ່ຂົ່ມຂູ່ງຽບ

355
00:28:16,050 --> 00:28:19,550
[FISHLEGS]
Hey Hiccup, I've never seen a Gronkle to that before.
ມັນພໍໃຈທີ່ຮູ້ວ່າ ອາຫານທັງ ຫມົດ ຂອງພວກເຮົາຍັງຖືກຖິ້ມລົງໄປໃນຮູ.

356
00:28:20,050 --> 00:28:22,050
[TUFFNUT]
How'd you do that?
ດີເດີ້ ເພື່ອນ, ພວກເຮົາຈະເຮັດຢ່າງຊັກຊ້າໆ Hiccup
ກວດເບິ່ງແຜ່ນປອມ ຫນັງ ທີ່ຕິດໃສ່ເສື້ອຍືດ ຂອງລາວ

357
00:28:22,550 --> 00:28:26,050
[RUFFNUT]
It was really cool. He squirms and invents an excuse.
ຂ້ອຍຮູ້ວ່າມັນເບິ່ງບໍ່ດີແທ້ໆ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າເບິ່ງ... ນີ້ແມ່ນ, uh... ພວກເຂົາໄດ້ຍິນສຽງ
RUSTLE ມາຈາກອີກດ້ານຫນຶ່ງຂອງ cove. Astrid ປ່ອຍ Hiccup ລົງພື້ນແລະອອກໄປເພື່ອສືບສວນ.

358
00:28:26,550 --> 00:28:31,100
[HICCUP]
I left my axe back in the ring. He turns and hurries back.
ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຢ້ານເຂົາ.

359
00:28:31,600 --> 00:28:36,500
[HICCUP]
You guys go on ahead and I'll catch up with you. Astrid watches, suspicious.
ດີ, ມັນເຖິງເວລາແລ້ວ, ມັນຮອດເວລາແລ້ວ
ເຂົາເຈົ້າໂດດລົງໄປຫາມັນ, ແຖວເພື່ອຜ່ານກະແສ.

360
00:28:37,000 --> 00:28:39,000
[FISHLEGS]
Hey Hiccup!
AAAAUUGGGHHH! ເປັນຫຍັງເຈົ້າຈຶ່ງເຮັດແບບນັ້ນ?!

361
00:28:39,500 --> 00:28:43,350
[SNOTLOUT]
What was that? Some kind of trick? What did you do?
ຂ້ອຍຄວນໄປນອນ.

362
00:28:43,850 --> 00:28:47,700
[TUFFNUT]
Hiccup, you're totally going to come in first, there's no question.
Hiccup, ພວກເຮົາຫາກໍ່ພົບເຫັນຮົ້ວຂອງມ້າ... ສິ່ງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຍັງຫາມາຕັ້ງແຕ່ຊາວໄວຄິງໄດ້ເດີນເຮືອມາຄັ້ງທໍາອິດ.
ແລະທ່ານຕ້ອງການຮັກສາມັນເປັນຄວາມລັບ? ເພື່ອປົກປັກຮັກສາມ້າລ້ຽງຂອງທ່ານ? ທ່ານຈິງໃຈບໍ? Hickup ຢືນຫມັ້ນຄົງ, ຕັດສິນໃຈ.

363
00:28:48,200 --> 00:28:50,200
[GOBBER]
Meet the Terrible Terror.
ດີແລ້ວ.

364
00:28:50,700 --> 00:28:55,600
[TUFFNUT]
Ha. It's like the size of my-- Tuffnut is taken down in a blur.
ບໍ່!

365
00:28:56,100 --> 00:29:02,100
[TUFFNUT]
Get it off! Get it off! Oh! I'm hurt, I am very much hurt! Hiccup stops the Terrible Terror with the same light-patch trick he used earlier with Toothless. The tiny dragon retreats back to it's cage. The teens approach him yet again as Astrid looks on with suspicion.
ດີແລ້ວ, ດີແລ້ວ. ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງມຸມຕົວເອງ. ບໍ່, ບໍ່...ລົງມາຫາຂ້ອຍ. ລົງມາຫາຂ້າພະເຈົ້າ-- Hiccup ຍືດແຂນແລະຂາຂອງຕົນ, ໃຫ້ຕົນເອງພື້ນທີ່ພື້ນທີ່ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ເຂົາສາມາດ. ລາວມຸມກັບໄປຫາ Toothless ເປັນ
dragon falling WHACKS Hickup ກັບປີກຂອງເຂົາ. ຫລັງຈາກອີກສອງສາມ misses, Hick ໃນທີ່ສຸດ grabs HOLD ຂອງສາຍແອວແລະຈັດການເພື່ອລັອກໃນ -- ພຽງແຕ່ໃນເວລາທີ່ຈະດຶງ Toothful ອອກຈາກ dive ຂອງເຂົາ... ພຽງ

366
00:29:02,600 --> 00:29:05,050
[TUFFNUT]
Wow, he's better than you ever were.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ.

367
00:29:05,550 --> 00:29:07,550
[HICCUP]
Oh, great.
ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ຮູ້ວ່າເຈົ້າ...

368
00:29:08,050 --> 00:29:14,050
[VIKING]
Hiccup. Hiccup nods, trying to look casual. Once the coast is clear, he covertly steers Toothless into the Blacksmith's stall. Toothless PRESSES himself inside, rooting through stuff and making a racket. Astrid, walking nearby, is alerted.
ຕໍາແຫນ່ງສີ່, ບໍ່ມີສາມ. ພວກເຂົາເຈາະເມກ. ເປັນຄັ້ງທໍາອິດ, Hiccup ສາມາດເບິ່ງທັງຫມົດຂອງເກາະພາຍໃຕ້ພວກເຂົາ.
ມັນ shrinks ກັບແຕ່ລະວິນາທີທີ່ຜ່ານໄປ. ເຂົາ swallows ຢ່າງຫນັກແລະ tightening ການຈັບຂອງເຂົາກ່ຽວກັບການຈັບ.

369
00:29:14,550 --> 00:29:20,500
[ASTRID]
Hiccup? Hiccup FREEZES. Then frantically tries to pry the ring off the saddle hook. It won't budge.
ສະນັ້ນ.

370
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:27,000
[ASTRID]
Are you in there? Too late - she's right outside. ON ASTRID walking along the outside of the Blacksmith's. Hiccup JUMPS OUT the window and CLOSES the shutters behind him. Hiccup's harness line is stretched through the window, still attached to Toothless' saddle.
ເຈົ້າບໍ່... ໂສກໃຈບໍ?

371
00:29:27,500 --> 00:29:30,300
[HICCUP]
Astrid. Hey! Hi Astrid. Hi Astrid. Hi Astrid.
Toothless, ທ່ານ ກໍາ ລັງເຮັດແນວໃດ?! ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ນາງມັກພວກເຮົາ
! rocket Touthless ໄປຫາສະຫວັນແລະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ falling ຫົວເທິງຄໍ.

372
00:29:30,800 --> 00:29:36,800
[ASTRID]
I normally don't care what people do, but you're acting weird. Well, weirder. Toothless spots a nearby sheep and makes a move toward it. As a result, Hiccup is suddenly PULLED TIGHT against the window shutters. He STRIKES A POSE to compensate... then gets PULLED THROUGH the shutters. They snap back in Astrid's face. Astrid reopens them and finds nothing but an empty stall. In the distance, Toothless and Hiccup slip off unseen.
ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຂ້ອຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈສິ່ງທີ່ຄົນອື່ນເຮັດ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າກະທໍາແບບແປກໆ. ດີ, ແປກກວ່າ. Toothless ເຫັນແກະໃກ້ຄຽງແລະເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄປຫາມັນ. ໃນຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ, Hiccup ທັນທີຖືກດຶງເຂັ້ມງວດໃສ່ຕາຕະລາງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ
. ລາວ STRICKS A POSE ເພື່ອຊົດເຊີຍ... ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຖືກດຶງຜ່ານຕາ ຕະລາງ. ພວກເຂົາ snap ກັບຄືນໃນໃບຫນ້າຂອງ Astrid. Astrid ເປີດພວກມັນແລະບໍ່ພົບຫຍັງແຕ່ຕູ້ຫວ່າງ. ໃນໄລຍະໄກ

373
00:29:37,300 --> 00:29:39,300
[VIKING]
Where are the other ships?
ດີ! ຂ້ອຍ ຂໍໂທດ! ຂ້ອຍຂໍໂທດ! ພຽງແຕ່ເອົາຂ້ອຍອອກຈາກສິ່ງນີ້. Astrid ຖືກເອົາຊະນະ, ພະລັງງານຮຸກຮານຂອງນາງໄດ້ຫາຍໄປ. ພໍໃຈ, Toothless yields. ພວກເຂົາ level off ແລະຫົວຫນ້າຂຶ້ນໄປສູ່ເມກ. Astrid
ເປີດຕາຂອງນາງອີກເທື່ອຫນຶ່ງ, ແລະເບິ່ງໃນໂລກທີ່ນາງບໍ່ເຄີຍ dreamed ຂອງ. ນາງຍືດອອກແລະສໍາຜັດກັບເມກ, pierces ເສົາໄຫມ້ໃນສີສັນຄໍາ, ແລະ floats ເທິງຂະຫນາດໃຫຍ່, ຕ່າງດາວ Sky- ທັດສະນະ. ຄວາມຢ້ານ

374
00:29:39,800 --> 00:29:45,400
[SPITELOUT]
You don't want to know. Stoick lumbers past Gobber, leaving him staring at the trashed ship.
ເສຍດາຍ. ເຂົາເຈົ້າແລ່ນເຂົ້າໄປໃນເສົາກ້ອນຫີນອີກແຫ່ງນຶ່ງ
. ຂົ່ມຂູ່ທີ່ບໍ່ມີແຂ້ວ.

375
00:29:45,900 --> 00:29:49,050
[GOBBER]
Well, I trust you found the nest at least?
ອອກໄປຈາກທາງຂ້ອຍ ຂ້ອຍຈະຊະນະເລື່ອງນີ້

376
00:29:49,550 --> 00:29:51,550
[STOICK]
Not even close.
ນັ້ນແມ່ນສໍາລັບການລັກພາຕົວຂ້າພະເຈົ້າ Hiccup ເບິ່ງໄປຫາ Toothless ສໍາລັບການສະຫນັບສະຫນູນ SNOORTS
Toothles, dismissive Astrid grabs ລາວກຽມຕົວສໍາລັບການຕີອີກຄັ້ງຫນຶ່ງ ນາງ kisses Hickup ໃນ cheek

377
00:29:52,050 --> 00:29:58,050
[GOBBER]
Ah. Excellent. Gobber follows Stoick up the ramp and snags his duffle bag with his hook appendage, sharing the burden.
ລາວແມ່ນໃຜ?

378
00:29:58,550 --> 00:30:02,050
[STOICK]
I hope you had a little more success than me.
ເຈົ້າເບິ່ງຫຍັງ?

379
00:30:02,550 --> 00:30:08,550
[GOBBER]
Well, if by success, you mean that your parenting troubles are over with, then... yes. Stoick stops. What does that mean? A group of merry villagers rush past.
ພວກເຮົາຍັງຕາຍແລ້ວ, ພໍໃຈກັບການເດີນທາງຂອງ Astrid, Toothless ຫັນໄປ.

380
00:30:09,050 --> 00:30:11,150
[VIKING #1]
Congratulations Stoick! Everyone is so relieved.
...ອອກໄປ ພວກເຮົາກໍາລັງອອກໄປ ໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າເຈົ້າແລະຂ້ອຍ ກໍາ ລັງພັກຜ່ອນເລັກນ້ອຍ, ຕະຫຼອດໄປ
. Toothless ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີບ່ອນເບິ່ງເຫັນ. Hiccup ວາງກະຕ່າລົງແລະເປີດມັນ, ຫົວຂອງເຂົາ clouded ກັບບັນຫາ.

381
00:30:11,650 --> 00:30:15,150
[VIKING #2]
Out with the old and in with the new, right?!
ລະມັດລະວັງກັບມັງກຣນັ້ນ.

382
00:30:15,650 --> 00:30:18,100
[VIKING #3]
No one will miss that old nuisance!
ອັນໃດ...

383
00:30:18,600 --> 00:30:24,600
[VIKING #4]
The village is throwing a party to celebrate! Stoick is stunned, overwhelmed by the insensitivity. He turns to Gobber.
ໂອເຄ, Hiccup ໃນແຂນ.

384
00:30:25,100 --> 00:30:27,100
[STOICK]
He's... gone?
ການຮ້ອງໄຫ້ ແລະ ຮ້ອງໂຮຈາກຕຸລາການ

385
